 # AWS setup

 Configure your credentials with `aws configure`.
+
+An example `~/.aws/credentials` file looks like:
+
+```ini
+[default]
+aws_access_key_id = AKIA5JNQXQABCDEFGHIJ
+aws_secret_access_key = abcd1234EFGH5678ijkl9012MNOPqrst3456UVWX
+```
+
+Replace both values with the keys from your own IAM user. Never check the
+real values into git.
